cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "Tripwire: Canary documents for RAG"
abstract: >-
  Tripwire plants unique synthetic canary records in vector stores, one per
  permission boundary, and alerts with the boundary's name when a canary
  appears where it shouldn't: in another user's or tenant's answer, a log, a
  trace or outbound traffic.
authors:
